OL,3,GNEWSAUnexploded device discovered by
OL,4,Anovice detectorist
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist teams will decide whether to
OL,7,Fdetonate a "possible piece of ordnance"
OL,8,Fthat was discovered on a beach.
OL,10,FThe device was discovered by a novice
OL,11,Fdetectorist on Caister beach, in
OL,12,FNorfolk, on Saturday, with local
OL,13,Fcoastguards attending the scene at
OL,14,Fabout 15:45 BST.
OL,16,FCaister resident Emma Hastings said:
OL,17,F"They shut off the beach completely
OL,18,Fbecause the tide came back in and
OL,19,Fcovered it."
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
